\tag{fdip}
\title{Counting the quaternionic link pairs}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The determinant in \ref{fdip-00ZD} depends on two
rational scalars. The explicit unit list in
\ref{fdip-00V1} lets their values be counted by separating
central units, coordinate-axis units and half-integer
units. This count also retains the trace around the
first loop.}

